### Example requests - open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request".
@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### API index
GET {{base}}

### ---------- Manufacturers ----------

GET {{base}}/manufacturers

### Filter
GET {{base}}/manufacturers?country=Germany&prestige=true

### One manufacturer
GET {{base}}/manufacturers/1

### All stock for a brand
GET {{base}}/manufacturers/1/cars

### Create
POST {{base}}/manufacturers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kia", "country": "South Korea", "foundedYear": 1944, "website": "https://www.kia.com" }

### Partial update
PATCH {{base}}/manufacturers/11
Content-Type: application/json

{ "foundedYear": 1945 }

### Delete (409 if cars still reference it)
DELETE {{base}}/manufacturers/11

### ---------- Dealers ----------

GET {{base}}/dealers?location=Ringwood

### Dealers authorised for BMW
GET {{base}}/dealers?manufacturerId=8

###
GET {{base}}/dealers/1

### A dealer's stock
GET {{base}}/dealers/1/cars?sort=price

### Create
POST {{base}}/dealers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ringwood Korean Cars",
  "location": "Ringwood",
  "phone": "03 9000 0010",
  "email": "sales@ringwoodkorean.example",
  "manufacturerIds": [3],
  "tradingHours": "Mon-Sat 9am-5pm"
}

### ---------- Cars ----------

### Filter, sort, paginate
GET {{base}}/cars?condition=used&maxPrice=40000&sort=-year&page=1&limit=5

### Search, filter by site, embed related objects
GET {{base}}/cars?q=rav&location=Ringwood&expand=manufacturer,dealer

###
GET {{base}}/cars/1?expand=dealer

### Create
POST {{base}}/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "manufacturerId": 1,
  "dealerId": 1,
  "model": "Corolla",
  "variant": "Ascent Sport",
  "year": 2025,
  "price": 31990,
  "condition": "new",
  "bodyType": "Hatchback",
  "transmission": "Automatic",
  "fuelType": "Hybrid",
  "colour": "Red"
}

### Mark as sold
PATCH {{base}}/cars/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "sold" }

### Business rule violation (422): Eastside Motors can't sell a NEW BMW
POST {{base}}/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "manufacturerId": 8, "dealerId": 1, "model": "X3", "year": 2025, "price": 89000,
  "condition": "new", "bodyType": "SUV", "transmission": "Automatic", "fuelType": "Petrol"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/cars/1
